Package: transformerpalettes
Title: Color Palettes Inspired by Generation 1 Transformers
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Brian", "Maitner", , "bmaitner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Color palettes based on the original 1984-1988 Generation 1
    Transformers toys: the leaders, every member and combined form of the
    combiner teams (Aerialbots, Protectobots, Technobots, Constructicons,
    Stunticons, Combaticons, Terrorcons, Predacons, Seacons, Pretender
    Monsters and Breastforce), the Dinobots, the Seeker jets, Soundwave and
    the cassettes, the Insecticons, the 1984 Autobot cars and Mini Vehicles
    and the 1986 movie cast, with separate palettes for the toy, the cartoon
    animation model, the Marvel comic colouring and the Generation 2
    re-release where each exists.
    Includes ggplot2 colour and fill scales for discrete and
    continuous data, team palettes that take one colour from each member of a
    combiner team, metadata linking each palette to its character, faction,
    team and reference page, and helpers to shortlist palettes that suit
    categorical, colour-blind-safe, sequential or diverging use. Hex values
    are approximations of the toys' plastic and paint colours; transformerpalettes
    is a fan project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Hasbro or
    Takara Tomy.
